   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el31",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 540,
   "width": 1395.3600000000001,
   "height": 127.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#343a40",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 508973970,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 707007883,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. ZKsync OS executes the batch; its output includes daCommitment = keccak256(blob versioned hashes).\n2. Operator publishes the pubdata as blobs: attached to the commit tx, or earlier via publishBlobs().\n3. Operator commits CommitBatchInfoZKsyncOS {daCommitmentScheme, daCommitment, operatorDAInput}.\n4. ValidatorTimelock checks COMMITTER_ROLE and forwards the call to the chain diamond.\n5. CommitterFacet requires daCommitmentScheme == s.l2DACommitmentScheme and calls s.l1DAValidator.checkDA; both values also enter the batch output hash.\n6. Validator rebuilds the blob versioned hashes and requires keccak256(hashes) == daCommitment.",
   "originalText": "1. ZKsync OS executes the batch; its output includes daCommitment = keccak256(blob versioned hashes).\n2. Operator publishes the pubdata as blobs: attached to the commit tx, or earlier via publishBlobs().\n3. Operator commits CommitBatchInfoZKsyncOS {daCommitmentScheme, daCommitment, operatorDAInput}.\n4. ValidatorTimelock checks COMMITTER_ROLE and forwards the call to the chain diamond.\n5. CommitterFacet requires daCommitmentScheme == s.l2DACommitmentScheme and calls s.l1DAValidator.checkDA; both values also enter the batch output hash.\n6. Validator rebuilds the blob versioned hashes and requires keccak256(hashes) == daCommitment.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
